{"getBaseConditions contains unreachable else branches (else if (filterConditions) and final else) because getAuthorizationConditions always returns a Prisma.Sql (defaulting to NOTHING_CONDITION), so authConditions is never falsy. Either allow getAuthorizationConditions to return null to make these branches meaningful, or simplify getBaseConditions to assume authConditions is always present.": 0.5476972460746765}